## 2. Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Framework** | FastAPI 0.115+ | High-performance asynchronous REST API |
| **Server** | Uvicorn | ASGI web server |
| **ORM** | SQLAlchemy 2.0+ | Database modeling and queries |
| **Migrations** | Alembic 1.13+ | Schema versioning and auto-generation |
| **Validation** | Pydantic v2 + Pydantic-Settings | Request parsing and environment management |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL / SQLite | Data persistence (SQLite default for tests/local dev) |
| **Authentication** | PyJWT + Bcrypt | Cryptographic JWT tokens and salted password hashes |
| **Testing** | Pytest + HTTPX + Starlette TestClient | Automated test suite with in-memory isolation |

