## 5. Standardized Error Response Format

All error responses follow this exact schema to prevent security leaks:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "EMAIL_ALREADY_REGISTERED",
    "message": "An account with this email address already exists.",
    "request_id": "c1f7bca4-927b-4029-a78b-d7db9b48c3b4"
  }
}
```

